 id="mwF-4"><a href="#cite_ref-2" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwF-8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwF_A">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-2" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt350" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwF_E" data-mw=\'{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://www.northropgrumman.com/who-we-are/contact-us-northrop-grumman"},"title":{"wt":"Contact Us"},"publisher":{"wt":"Northrop Grumman"},"access-date":{"wt":"2025-10-15"},"quote":{"wt":"Global Headquarters Northrop Grumman Corporation 2980 Fairview Park Drive Falls Church, VA 22042"}},"i":0}}]}\'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt350" id="mwF_I"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.northropgrumman.com/who-we-are/contact-us-northrop-grumman" class="external text" id="mwF_M">"Contact Us"</a>. Northrop Grumman<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwF_Q">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwF_U">October 15,</span> 2025</span>. <q id="mwF_Y">Global Headquarters Northrop Grumman Corporation 2980 Fairview Park Drive Falls Church, VA 22042</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Contact+Us&amp;rft.pub=Northrop+Grumman&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.northropgrumman.com%2Fwho-we-are%2Fcontact-us-northrop-grumman&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AList+of+S%26P+500+companies" class="Z3988" about="#mwt350" id="mwF_c"></span><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Entity" about="#mwt352" id="mwF_g" data-mw=\'{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"snd","href":"./Template:Snd"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}\'>\xa0</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt352" id="mwF_k">–</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt352" id="mwF_o"> </span>Even though the postal address says "Falls Church, VA", the place is physically in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Falls_Church,_Virginia" title="West Falls Church, Virginia" id="mwF_s">West Falls Church, Virginia</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Census-designated_place" title="Census-designated place" id="mwF_w">census-designated place</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairfax_County,_Virginia" title="Fairfax County, Virginia" id="mwF_0">Fairfax County</a>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www2.census.gov/geo/maps/DC2020/DC20BLK/st51_va/place/p5184368_west_falls_church/DC20BLK_P5184368.pdf" class="external text" id="mwF_4">See map here</a>.<!--The HQ is actually in Fairfax County. In Virginia, cities are separate from counties. It is impossible for a place in Fairfax County to be in Falls Church city.--></span></li>\n<li about="#cite_note-3" id="cite_note-3" data-mw-footnote-number="3"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwF_8"><a href="#cite_ref-3" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwGAA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwGAE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-3" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt355" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwGAI" data-mw=\'{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://www.ncl.com/terms/privacy-policy"},"title":{"wt":"Privacy Policy"},"publisher":{"wt":"[[Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings]]"},"access-date":{"wt":"2025-10-25"},"quote":{"wt":"Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings Ltd. Legal Department: Privacy Team 7665 Corporate Center Drive Miami, Florida 33126"}},"i":0}}]}\'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt355" id="mwGAM"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.ncl.com/terms/privacy-policy" class="external text" id="mwGAQ">"Privacy Policy"</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norwegian_Cruise_Line_Holdings" title="Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings" id="mwGAU">Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings</a><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwGAY">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwGAc">October 25,</span> 2025</span>. <q id="mwGAg">Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings Ltd. Legal Department: Privacy Team 7665 Corporate Center Drive Miami, Florida 33126</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Privacy+Policy&amp;rft.pub=Norwegian+Cruise+Line+Holdings&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncl.com%2Fterms%2Fprivacy-policy&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AList+of+S%26P+500+companies" class="Z3988" about="#mwt355" id="mwGAk"></span><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Entity" about="#mwt357" id="mwGAo" data-mw=\'{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"snd","href":"./Template:Snd"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}\'>\xa0</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt357" id="mwGAs">–</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt357" id="mwGAw"> </span>The office location is outside of the Miami city limits: <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www2.census.gov/geo/maps/DC2020/DC20BLK/st12_fl/county/c12086_miami-dade/DC20BLK_C12086.pdf" class="external text" id="mwGA0">Miami-Dade County census map page 31/154</a>.</span></li>\n</ol></div></div>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwGA4" aria-labelledby="External_links"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="External_links">External links</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_S%26P_500_companies&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: External links"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>\n<ul 